--fallocate through the C library's fallocate().

fallocate.c reaches the system call through syscall(SYS_fallocate, ...) and
reports "built without support" when that name is missing.  The LikeOS C
library has fallocate() itself (the system call has its own number there),
so the LikeOS branch calls it directly with the same arguments.

